\highlight2\fs32 0.1. T\'ean \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7873? t\f4\lang1033\'e0i : \par
\highlight3\b0\fs22 Thi\f3\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? Tr\u7843?i nghi\u7879?m Ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng (UX) v\'e0 Giao di\f3\lang1066\u7879?n (UI) cho \u7912?ng d\u7909?ng Theo d\f4\lang1033\'f5i S\f3\lang1066\u7913?c kh\u7887?e C\f4\lang1033\'e1 nh\'e2n \f6\endash  Health Alpha.\highlight2\par
\highlight1\par
\highlight2\b\fs32 0.2. L\f4\'fd do ch\f3\lang1066\u7885?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7873? t\f4\lang1033\'e0i\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22 Trong b\f3\lang1066\u7889?i c\u7843?nh h\u7853?u \f5\'f0\f3\u7841?i d\u7883?ch v\f4\lang1033\'e0 xu h\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?ng n\f4\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f3\lang1066\u7845?t l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng cu\u7897?c s\u7889?ng, nhu c\u7847?u ch\u7911? \f5\'f0\f3\u7897?ng qu\u7843?n l\f4\lang1033\'fd c\'e1c ch\f3\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? sinh t\u7891?n (nh\u7883?p tim, n\u7891?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7897? oxy trong m\f4\lang1033\'e1u SpO2, huy\f3\lang1066\u7871?t \f4\lang1033\'e1p, gi\f3\lang1066\u7845?c ng\u7911?) gia t\f5\'e3ng m\f3\u7841?nh m\u7869?.\f4\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 Tuy nhi\f4\lang1033\'ean, qua kh\f3\lang1066\u7843?o s\f4\lang1033\'e1t s\f5\u417? b\f3\lang1066\u7897?, ph\u7847?n l\u7899?n c\f4\lang1033\'e1c \f3\lang1066\u7913?ng d\u7909?ng theo d\f4\lang1033\'f5i s\f3\lang1066\u7913?c kh\u7887?e hi\u7879?n nay g\u7863?p ph\u7843?i hai nh\f4\lang1033\'f3m v\f3\lang1066\u7845?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7873? l\u7899?n:\par
\f4\lang1033\tab +  \f3\lang1066 Qu\f4\lang1033\'e1 t\f3\lang1066\u7843?i th\f4\lang1033\'f4ng tin & Thao t\'e1c r\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?m r\f4\lang1033\'e0 : Ng\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng tr\f3\lang1066\u7867?/v\f5\'e3n ph\f4\lang1033\'f2ng b\f3\lang1066\u7853?n r\u7897?n d\u7877? t\u7915? b\u7887? th\f4\lang1033\'f3i quen ghi ch\'e9p do ph\f3\lang1066\u7843?i tr\u7843?i qua qu\f4\lang1033\'e1 nhi\f3\lang1066\u7873?u b\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?c nh\u7853?p li\u7879?u ph\u7913?c t\u7841?p.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab +  \f3\lang1066 Th\f4\lang1033\'e1ch th\f3\lang1066\u7913?c v\u7873? tr\u7907? n\f5\'e3ng (Accessibility): \'d0\f3\u7889?i t\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i cao tu\u7893?i ho\u7863?c ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i c\f4\lang1033\'f3 b\f3\lang1066\u7879?nh n\u7873?n nh\u7865? g\u7863?p nhi\u7873?u r\f4\lang1033\'e0o c\f3\lang1066\u7843?n do font ch\u7919? nh\u7887?, m\f4\lang1033\'e0u s\f3\lang1066\u7855?c \f5\'f0\f3\u7897? t\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f3\u7843?n k\f4\lang1033\'e9m v\'e0 bi\f3\lang1066\u7875?u \f5\'f0\f3\u7891? ph\f4\lang1033\'e2n t\'edch r\f3\lang1066\u7855?c r\u7889?i, thi\u7871?u t\f4\lang1033\'ednh c\f3\lang1066\u7843?nh b\f4\lang1033\'e1o t\f3\lang1066\u7913?c th\f4\lang1033\'ec.\par
\f5\par
\'d0\f3\lang1066\u7873? t\f4\lang1033\'e0i Health Alpha \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c l\u7921?a ch\u7885?n nh\u7857?m gi\u7843?i quy\u7871?t tr\u7921?c di\u7879?n c\f4\lang1033\'e1c h\f3\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871? tr\f4\lang1033\'ean b\f3\lang1066\u7857?ng c\f4\lang1033\'e1ch \f3\lang1066\u7913?ng d\u7909?ng quy tr\f4\lang1033\'ecnh Thi\f3\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? h\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?ng ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng (Human-Centered Design), t\f3\lang1066\u7889?i \f5\u432?u h\f4\lang1033\'f3a th\f3\lang1066\u7901?i gian t\f5\u432?\u417?ng t\f4\lang1033\'e1c d\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?i 30 gi\f4\lang1033\'e2y cho m\f3\lang1066\u7895?i t\f4\lang1033\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7909?.\par
\b\fs32\par
\highlight2 0.3. M\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7873? t\f4\lang1033\'e0i\highlight3\fs22\par
\highlight0\b0\par
\highlight3\b M\f3\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau UX:\highlight0\b0  X\'e2y d\f3\lang1066\u7921?ng lu\u7891?ng t\f5\u432?\u417?ng t\f4\lang1033\'e1c t\f3\lang1066\u7889?i \f5\u432?u, gi\f3\u7843?m t\u7927? l\u7879? b\u7887? d\u7903? \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng xu\u7889?ng d\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?i 20% sau tu\u7847?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7847?u ti\f4\lang1033\'ean; \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7843?m b\u7843?o th\u7901?i gian cho t\f4\lang1033\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7909? ghi ch\f4\lang1033\'e9p nhanh (Quick Log) \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7841?t 5\f6\endash 10 gi\f4\lang1033\'e2y.\par
\par
\highlight3\b M\f3\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau UI:\b0  \highlight0 Thi\f3\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? h\u7879? th\u7889?ng giao di\u7879?n tr\u7921?c quan, \f5\'f0\f3\u7841?t chu\u7849?n tr\u7907? n\f5\'e3ng WCAG 2.1 (\'f0\f3\u7897? t\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f3\u7843?n, c\u7905? ch\u7919? t\u7889?i thi\u7875?u \f4\lang1033 28 \f3\lang1066 cho ch\u7881? s\u7889? c\u7889?t l\f4\lang1033\'f5i, Thumb Zone t\f3\lang1066\u7889?i \f5\u432?u).\par
\par
\highlight3\b M\f3\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau An to\'e0n\b0 : \highlight0 X\'e2y d\f3\lang1066\u7921?ng h\u7879? th\u7889?ng C\u7843?nh b\f4\lang1033\'e1o Kh\f3\lang1066\u7849?n c\u7845?p (High-Alert System) ph\u7843?n \u7913?ng t\u7913?c th\f4\lang1033\'ec khi ch\f3\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? sinh t\u7891?n v\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?t ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7905?ng nguy hi\u7875?m.\par
\par
\highlight1\b\fs40 CH\f5\u431?\u416?NG 1: C\u416? S\f3\u7902? L\f4\lang1033\'dd THUY\f3\lang1066\u7870?T\par
\highlight0\fs22\par
\highlight2\fs32 1.1. T\u7893?ng quan v\u7873? UX (User Experience)\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22\par
\highlight3 1.1.1. L\u7883?ch s\u7917? ra \f5\'f0\f3\u7901?i UX\highlight0 : Kh\f4\lang1033\'e1i ni\f3\lang1066\u7879?m "User Experience" \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\u7907?c Don Norman \f5\'f0\u432?a ra v\f4\lang1033\'e0o th\f3\lang1066\u7853?p ni\f4\lang1033\'ean 1990 t\f3\lang1066\u7841?i Apple, \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh d\f3\lang1066\u7845?u b\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?c chuy\u7875?n t\u7915? thi\u7871?t k\u7871? ch\f4\lang1033\'fa tr\f3\lang1066\u7885?ng ch\u7913?c n\f5\'e3ng k\f3\u7929? thu\u7853?t sang thi\u7871?t k\u7871? t\u7853?p trung v\f4\lang1033\'e0o c\f3\lang1066\u7843?m x\f4\lang1033\'fac, kh\f3\lang1066\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng s\f3\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\f4\lang1033\'e0 m\f3\lang1066\u7913?c \f5\'f0\f3\u7897? h\f4\lang1033\'e0i l\'f2ng c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a con ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i.\par
\par
\highlight3 1.1.2. Kh\f4\lang1033\'e1i ni\f3\lang1066\u7879?m UX\highlight0 : Theo ti\f4\lang1033\'eau chu\f3\lang1066\u7849?n ISO 9241-210, UX bao g\u7891?m to\f4\lang1033\'e0n b\f3\lang1066\u7897? nh\u7853?n th\u7913?c, c\u7843?m x\f4\lang1033\'fac, ph\f3\lang1066\u7843?n \u7913?ng sinh l\f4\lang1033\'fd v\'e0 h\'e0nh vi c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng tr\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?c, trong v\f4\lang1033\'e0 sau khi t\f5\u432?\u417?ng t\f4\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7899?i s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m ho\u7863?c d\u7883?ch v\u7909?.\par
\par
\highlight3 1.1.3. C\f4\lang1033\'e1c kh\'eda c\f3\lang1066\u7841?nh c\u7889?t l\f4\lang1033\'f5i trong UX Design:\highlight0\par
\tab + UI Design (User Interface): Thi\f3\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? \f5\'f0i\f3\u7875?m nh\f4\lang1033\'ecn v\'e0 h\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng h\f4\lang1033\'ecnh \f3\lang1066\u7843?nh (m\f4\lang1033\'e0u s\f3\lang1066\u7855?c, \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 typography, layout).\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 IA (Information Architecture): T\u7893? ch\u7913?c, s\u7855?p x\u7871?p v\f4\lang1033\'e0 d\'e1n nh\'e3n n\f3\lang1066\u7897?i dung gi\f4\lang1033\'fap ng\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng d\f3\lang1066\u7877? \f4\lang1033\tab\f5\lang1066\'f0\f3\u7883?nh v\u7883?.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 IxD (Interaction Design): \f5\'d0\f3\u7883?nh ngh\f5\u297?a c\f4\lang1033\'e1ch h\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\u7843?n h\u7891?i l\u7841?i h\f4\lang1033\'e0nh \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7897?ng c\u7911?a ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng \tab (animation, haptic feedback).\par
\tab + Accessibility (Tr\f3\lang1066\u7907? n\f5\'e3ng): \'d0\f3\u7843?m b\u7843?o ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng \f3\lang1066\u7903? m\u7885?i l\u7913?a tu\u7893?i v\f4\lang1033\'e0 kh\f3\lang1066\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng (k\f3\u7875? c\u7843? th\u7883? l\u7921?c \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 k\f4\lang1033\'e9m) \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7873?u truy c\u7853?p \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\u7907?c.\par
\par
\highlight2\b\fs32 1.2. Ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\lang1033\'e1p nghi\'ean c\f3\lang1066\u7913?u ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng (User Research Methods)\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22\par
\highlight3 1.2.1 :  Kh\f3\lang1066\u7843?o s\f4\lang1033\'e1t \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7883?nh l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng (Quantitative Survey)\f4\lang1033  \highlight0\f3\lang1066 :\f4\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 S\u7917? d\u7909?ng bi\u7875?u m\u7851?u tr\u7921?c tuy\u7871?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? thu th\u7853?p d\u7919? li\u7879?u tr\f4\lang1033\'ean m\f3\lang1066\u7851?u r\u7897?ng (n = 150), \f5\'f0o l\u432?\f3\u7901?ng t\u7847?n su\u7845?t s\u7917? d\u7909?ng, t\u7927? l\u7879? b\u7887? app v\f4\lang1033\'e0 nhu c\f3\lang1066\u7847?u c\u7843?nh b\f4\lang1033\'e1o.\par
\highlight3 1.2.2 : Ph\f3\lang1066\u7887?ng v\u7845?n s\f4\lang1033\'e2u \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7883?nh t\f4\lang1033\'ednh (Qualitative In-depth Interview)\highlight0 : Ph\f3\lang1066\u7887?ng v\u7845?n tr\u7921?c ti\u7871?p 8 ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng thu\f3\lang1066\u7897?c c\f4\lang1033\'e1c nh\'f3m m\f3\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau nh\f3\lang1066\u7857?m \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e0o s\'e2u \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c, r\f4\lang1033\'e0o c\f3\lang1066\u7843?n t\f4\lang1033\'e2m l\'fd v\'e0 ng\f3\lang1066\u7919? c\u7843?nh s\u7917? d\u7909?ng th\u7921?c t\u7871?.\par
\highlight3\f4\lang1033 1.2.3 : \f3\lang1066 Ch\f4\lang1033\'e2n dung ng\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng (User Persona) & B\f3\lang1066\u7843?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7891? h\f4\lang1033\'e0nh tr\'ecnh (Customer Journey Map - CJM)\highlight0 : Tr\f3\lang1066\u7921?c quan h\f4\lang1033\'f3a h\'ecnh m\f3\lang1066\u7851?u ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng \f5\'f0i\f3\lang1066\u7875?n h\f4\lang1033\'ecnh v\'e0 tr\f3\lang1066\u7843?i nghi\u7879?m t\u7915?ng ch\u7863?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? ph\f4\lang1033\'e1t hi\f3\lang1066\u7879?n \f5\'f0i\f3\u7875?m \f5\'f0au (Pain Points) v\f4\lang1033\'e0 c\f5\u417? h\f3\lang1066\u7897?i thi\u7871?t k\u7871? (UX Opportunities).\par
\par
\highlight2\b\fs32 1.3. Quy tr\f4\lang1033\'ecnh thi\f3\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? (Design Process)\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22\par
\f4\lang1033\'c1p d\f3\lang1066\u7909?ng m\f4\lang1033\'f4 h\'ecnh \highlight3 Design Thinking 5 giai \f5\'f0o\f3\lang1066\u7841?n c\u7911?a Hasso Plattner Institute\highlight0  (Stanford d.school)\par
\f4\lang1033\tab\par
\highlight3 1.3.1 :  \f3\lang1066 Empathize \highlight0 (Th\u7845?u hi\u7875?u): Kh\u7843?o s\f4\lang1033\'e1t v\'e0 ph\f3\lang1066\u7887?ng v\u7845?n ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng.\par
\highlight3 1.3.2 : Define \highlight0 (X\'e1c \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7883?nh v\u7845?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7873?): T\u7893?ng h\u7907?p Pain Points, x\f4\lang1033\'e2y d\f3\lang1066\u7921?ng Persona v\f4\lang1033\'e0 CJM.\par
\highlight3 1.3.3 :  Ideate \highlight0 (H\'ecnh th\'e0nh \'fd t\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7903?ng): Brainstorming gi\u7843?i ph\f4\lang1033\'e1p, s\f5\u417? \'f0\f3\lang1066\u7891? h\f4\lang1033\'f3a Ki\f3\lang1066\u7871?n tr\f4\lang1033\'fac th\'f4ng tin (IA).\par
\highlight3 1.3.4 : Prototype \highlight0 (T\f3\lang1066\u7841?o m\u7851?u th\u7917?): T\u7915? Hand Sketch, Low-Fi Wireframe \f5\'f0\f3\u7871?n High-Fi Interactive Prototype.\par
\highlight3\f4\lang1033 1.3.5 : \f3\lang1066 Test \highlight0 (Th\u7917? nghi\u7879?m & \f5\'d0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1): Ki\f3\lang1066\u7875?m th\u7917? kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng (Usability Testing) v\f4\lang1033\'e0 \f5\'f0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 Heuristic.\par
\par
\highlight2\b\fs32 1.4. Ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\'e1p \f5\'f0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 tr\f3\lang1066\u7843?i nghi\u7879?m (UX Evaluation Methods)\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22\par
\f5\'d0\f3\u7875? \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 ch\f3\lang1066\u7845?t l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng tr\u7843?i nghi\u7879?m ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng Health Alpha, \f5\'f0\f3\u7873? t\f4\lang1033\'e0i s\f3\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng k\u7871?t h\u7907?p hai ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\lang1033\'e1p ch\'ednh: \f5\'d0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 kh\f3\lang1066\u7843? d\u7909?ng theo nguy\f4\lang1033\'ean t\f3\lang1066\u7855?c Heuristic (Heuristic Evaluation) v\f4\lang1033\'e0 Ki\f3\lang1066\u7875?m th\u7917? kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng d\u7921?a tr\f4\lang1033\'ean nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? (Task-based Usability Testing). Vi\u7879?c k\u7871?t h\u7907?p hai ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\lang1033\'e1p gi\'fap \f5\'f0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 c\f3\lang1066\u7843? ch\u7845?t l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng giao di\u7879?n \u7903? g\f4\lang1033\'f3c \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7897? chuy\f4\lang1033\'ean gia v\'e0 kh\f3\lang1066\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng s\f3\u7917? d\u7909?ng th\u7921?c t\u7871? c\u7911?a ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng.\par
\par
\highlight3 1.4.1. \f5\'d0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 theo 10 nguy\'ean t\f3\lang1066\u7855?c kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng c\u7911?a Jakob Nielsen (Heuristic Evaluation)\par
\highlight0\par
Heuristic Evaluation l\f4\lang1033\'e0 ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\'e1p \f5\'f0\f4\'e1nh gi\'e1 giao di\f3\lang1066\u7879?n d\u7921?a tr\f4\lang1033\'ean 10 nguy\'ean t\f3\lang1066\u7855?c kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng c\u7911?a Jakob Nielsen. Ph\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f4\lang1033\'e1p n\'e0y \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? ph\f4\lang1033\'e1t hi\f3\lang1066\u7879?n s\u7899?m c\f4\lang1033\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7845?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7873? v\u7873? kh\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng s\f3\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\f4\lang1033\'e0 t\'ednh nh\f3\lang1066\u7845?t qu\f4\lang1033\'e1n c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a giao di\u7879?n.\par
\par
\f5\'d0\f3\u7889?i v\u7899?i Health Alpha, vi\u7879?c \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 t\f3\lang1066\u7853?p trung v\f4\lang1033\'e0o c\'e1c y\f3\lang1066\u7871?u t\u7889? quan tr\u7885?ng nh\f5\u432?:\par
\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 1 . \f5\lang1066 Kh\f3\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng hi\f3\u7875?n th\u7883? tr\u7841?ng th\f4\lang1033\'e1i h\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng: Ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng c\f3\lang1066\u7847?n bi\u7871?t r\f4\lang1033\'f5 d\f3\lang1066\u7919? li\u7879?u s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e3 \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 ghi nh\u7853?n, \f5\'f0\f3\u7891?ng b\u7897? ho\u7863?c c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t th\f4\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng hay ch\f5\u432?a.\par
\f4\tab 2. \f5 T\f4\'ednh nh\f3\lang1066\u7845?t qu\f4\lang1033\'e1n v\'e0 ti\'eau chu\f3\lang1066\u7849?n: M\f4\lang1033\'e0u s\f3\lang1066\u7855?c, bi\u7875?u t\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng, thu\u7853?t ng\u7919?, n\f4\lang1033\'fat b\f3\lang1066\u7845?m v\f4\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1ch tr\'ecnh b\'e0y \tab th\'f4ng tin ph\f3\lang1066\u7843?i th\u7889?ng nh\u7845?t gi\u7919?a c\f4\lang1033\'e1c m\'e0n h\'ecnh.\par
\tab 3.Ph\'f2ng ng\f3\lang1066\u7915?a l\u7895?i: H\u7879? th\u7889?ng c\u7847?n h\u7841?n ch\u7871? l\u7895?i nh\u7853?p li\u7879?u, c\u7843?nh b\f4\lang1033\'e1o khi d\f3\lang1066\u7919? li\u7879?u b\u7845?t th\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?ng v\f4\lang1033\'e0 \tab y\'eau c\f3\lang1066\u7847?u x\f4\lang1033\'e1c nh\f3\lang1066\u7853?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7889?i v\u7899?i c\f4\lang1033\'e1c thao t\'e1c quan tr\f3\lang1066\u7885?ng.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 4.\f3\lang1066 Gi\u7843?m t\u7843?i ghi nh\u7899?: Ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c cung c\u7845?p c\f4\lang1033\'e1c gi\'e1 tr\f3\lang1066\u7883? \f5\'f0\f3\u7883?nh l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng s\u7861?n nh\f5\u432? \ldblquote +250 ml\rdblquote  \f4\lang1033\tab\f5\lang1066 thay v\f4\lang1033\'ec ph\f3\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7853?p th\u7911? c\f4\lang1033\'f4ng nhi\f3\lang1066\u7873?u b\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?c.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 5.\f3\lang1066 T\f4\lang1033\'ednh linh ho\f3\lang1066\u7841?t v\f4\lang1033\'e0 hi\f3\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng: Quick Log v\f4\lang1033\'e0 Voice Input gi\'fap ng\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng c\'f3 th\f3\lang1066\u7875? ho\f4\lang1033\'e0n \tab th\'e0nh c\'e1c t\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7909? th\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?ng xuy\f4\lang1033\'ean v\f3\lang1066\u7899?i s\u7889? l\u7847?n t\f5\u432?\u417?ng t\f4\lang1033\'e1c t\f3\lang1066\u7889?i thi\u7875?u.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 6. \f3\lang1066 Thi\u7871?t k\u7871? t\u7889?i gi\u7843?n: Ch\u7881? \f5\u432?u ti\f4\lang1033\'ean c\'e1c ch\f3\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e quan tr\u7885?ng tr\f4\lang1033\'ean Dashboard, h\f3\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871? \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 th\f4\lang1033\'f4ng tin g\'e2y nhi\f3\lang1066\u7877?u.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 7.\f3\lang1066 H\u7895? tr\u7907? nh\u7853?n di\u7879?n v\f4\lang1033\'e0 kh\f3\lang1066\u7855?c ph\u7909?c l\u7895?i: Th\f4\lang1033\'f4ng b\'e1o l\f3\lang1066\u7895?i c\u7847?n s\u7917? d\u7909?ng ng\f4\lang1033\'f4n ng\f3\lang1066\u7919? d\u7877? hi\u7875?u v\f4\lang1033\'e0 h\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?ng \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 d\u7851?n ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng c\'e1ch x\f3\lang1066\u7917? l\f4\lang1033\'fd.\par
\tab 8.Tr\f3\lang1066\u7907? n\f5\'e3ng: C\f3\u7905? ch\u7919?, \f5\'f0\f3\u7897? t\f5\u432?\u417?ng ph\f3\u7843?n, k\f4\lang1033\'edch th\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?c v\f4\lang1033\'f9ng ch\f3\lang1066\u7841?m v\f4\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1ch bi\f3\lang1066\u7875?u di\u7877?n c\u7843?nh b\f4\lang1033\'e1o ph\f3\lang1066\u7843?i \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 ph\f4\lang1033\'f9 h\f3\lang1066\u7907?p v\u7899?i ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng l\f3\lang1066\u7899?n tu\u7893?i ho\u7863?c c\f4\lang1033\'f3 h\f3\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871? v\u7873? th\u7883? l\u7921?c.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab 9 . \f3\lang1066 Kh\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng hi\f3\u7875?n th\u7883? tr\u7841?ng th\f4\lang1033\'e1i h\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng (Visibility of System Status):\par
\f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 H\u7879? th\u7889?ng c\u7847?n th\f4\lang1033\'f4ng b\'e1o r\'f5 r\'e0ng cho ng\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng v\f3\lang1066\u7873? tr\u7841?ng th\f4\lang1033\'e1i c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a d\u7919? li\u7879?u s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e, ch\u7859?ng \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 h\u7841?n nh\f5\u432? d\f3\u7919? li\u7879?u \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e3 \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c ghi nh\u7853?n, \f5\'f0\f3\u7891?ng b\u7897? ho\u7863?c c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t th\f4\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng hay ch\f5\u432?a.\par
\f4\tab 10.\f5 S\f3\lang1066\u7921? t\f5\u432?\u417?ng th\f4\lang1033\'edch gi\f3\lang1066\u7919?a h\u7879? th\u7889?ng v\f4\lang1033\'e0 th\f3\lang1066\u7871? gi\u7899?i th\u7921?c (Match Between System and the Real \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 World):\f4\lang1033   \f3\lang1066 S\u7917? d\u7909?ng ng\f4\lang1033\'f4n ng\f3\lang1066\u7919?, thu\u7853?t ng\u7919? v\f4\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1ch bi\f3\lang1066\u7875?u di\u7877?n quen thu\u7897?c v\u7899?i ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng. C\'e1c ch\f3\lang1066\u7881? \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 s\u7889? nh\f5\u432? nh\f3\u7883?p tim\par
\par
\par
K\u7871?t qu\u7843? \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 Heuristic \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? x\f4\lang1033\'e1c \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7883?nh c\f4\lang1033\'e1c v\f3\lang1066\u7845?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7873? v\u7873? UX, t\u7915? \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'f3 \f5\'f0i\f3\lang1066\u7873?u ch\u7881?nh Wireframe v\f4\lang1033\'e0 High-Fidelity Prototype tr\f5\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7899?c khi ti\u7871?n h\f4\lang1033\'e0nh ki\f3\lang1066\u7875?m th\u7917? v\u7899?i ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng th\f3\lang1066\u7921?c t\u7871?.\par
\par
\highlight3 1.4.2. Ki\u7875?m th\u7917? kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng d\u7921?a tr\f4\lang1033\'ean nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? (Task-based Usability Testing)\par
\highlight0\par
Task-based Usability Testing \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 kh\f3\lang1066\u7843? n\f5\'e3ng ng\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng ho\'e0n th\'e0nh c\'e1c nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? c\u7909? th\u7875? trong nh\u7919?ng t\f4\lang1033\'ecnh hu\f3\lang1066\u7889?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng g\u7847?n v\u7899?i th\u7921?c t\u7871?.\par
\par
\f5\'d0\f3\u7889?i v\u7899?i Health Alpha, c\f4\lang1033\'e1c nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? ki\u7875?m th\u7917? ti\f4\lang1033\'eau bi\f3\lang1066\u7875?u g\u7891?m:\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 Ghi nh\u7853?n nhanh 250 ml n\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?c u\u7889?ng b\u7857?ng Quick Log.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 Ghi nh\u7853?n m\u7897?t ch\u7881? s\u7889? s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e b\u7857?ng Voice Input.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 Ki\u7875?m tra t\f4\lang1033\'ecnh tr\f3\lang1066\u7841?ng SpO2 v\f4\lang1033\'e0 nh\f3\lang1066\u7883?p tim tr\f4\lang1033\'ean Dashboard.\par
\tab + Xem l\f3\lang1066\u7883?ch s\u7917? v\f4\lang1033\'e0 bi\f3\lang1066\u7875?u \f5\'f0\f3\u7891? s\u7913?c kh\u7887?e.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 X\u7917? l\f4\lang1033\'fd t\'ecnh hu\f3\lang1066\u7889?ng khi h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ph\f4\lang1033\'e1t hi\f3\lang1066\u7879?n ch\u7881? s\u7889? b\u7845?t th\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?ng.\par
\par
C\f4\lang1033\'e1c ch\f3\lang1066\u7881? s\u7889? ch\f4\lang1033\'ednh \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\lang1066\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? \f5\'f0\f4\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 g\f3\lang1066\u7891?m:\par
\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 Time-on-Task: Th\u7901?i gian ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng c\f3\lang1066\u7847?n \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? ho\f4\lang1033\'e0n th\'e0nh m\f3\lang1066\u7897?t nhi\u7879?m v\u7909?, \f5\'f0\f3\u7863?c bi\u7879?t t\u7853?p trung \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 v\f4\lang1033\'e0o m\f3\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau Quick Log trong kho\f3\lang1066\u7843?ng 5\f6\endash 10 gi\f4\lang1033\'e2y.\par
\tab + Task Success Rate: T\f3\lang1066\u7927? l\u7879? ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng ho\'e0n th\'e0nh nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? th\f4\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\f3\lang1066\u7847?n s\u7921? \f4\lang1033\tab\f3\lang1066 h\u7895? \f4\lang1033  \f3\lang1066 tr\u7907? t\u7915? ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i ki\u7875?m th\u7917?.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 Error Rate: S\u7889? l\f5\u432?\f3\u7907?ng l\u7895?i ho\u7863?c thao t\f4\lang1033\'e1c sai trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh th\f3\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n nhi\u7879?m v\u7909?.\par
\f4\lang1033\tab + \f3\lang1066 User Satisfaction: M\u7913?c \f5\'f0\f3\u7897? h\f4\lang1033\'e0i l\'f2ng c\f3\lang1066\u7911?a ng\f5\u432?\f3\u7901?i d\f4\lang1033\'f9ng sau khi ho\'e0n th\'e0nh c\'e1c nhi\f3\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909?, c\f4\lang1033\'f3 \tab th\f3\lang1066\u7875? \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\u7907?c \f5\'f0o b\f3\u7857?ng b\u7843?ng h\u7887?i ho\u7863?c thang \f5\'f0o SUS (System Usability Scale).\par
\par
K\f3\u7871?t qu\u7843? ki\u7875?m th\u7917? \f5\'f0\u432?\f3\u7907?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f5\'f0\f3\u7875? so s\f4\lang1033\'e1nh v\f3\lang1066\u7899?i c\f4\lang1033\'e1c m\f3\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau UX ban \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7847?u, x\f4\lang1033\'e1c \f5\'f0\f3\lang1066\u7883?nh c\f4\lang1033\'e1c \f5\'f0i\f3\lang1066\u7875?m c\f4\lang1033\'f2n g\'e2y kh\'f3 kh\f5\'e3n v\f4\'e0 ti\f3\lang1066\u7871?p t\u7909?c c\u7843?i ti\u7871?n thi\u7871?t k\u7871? tr\f5\u432?\f3\u7899?c khi ho\f4\lang1033\'e0n thi\f3\lang1066\u7879?n s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m.\fs40\par
\highlight1\b\par
CH\f5\u431?\u416?NG 2: \f4\lang1033\'dd T\f5\u431?\f3\lang1066\u7902?NG THI\u7870?T K\u7870? \u7912?NG D\u7908?NG (V\u7852?N D\u7908?NG C\f5\u416? S\f3\u7902? L\f4\lang1033\'dd THUY\f3\lang1066\u7870?T)\par
\highlight0\b0\fs22\par
\highlight2\b\fs32 2.1. M\u7909?c ti\f4\lang1033\'eau ch\f3\lang1066\u7913?c n\f5\'e3ng c\f3\u7911?a \u7913?ng d\u7909?ng\b0\fs22\par
\highlight0\par
